; fennec.pulse.workflow — the non-web core's runtime: Workflow (ordinary functions wrapped in the
; transparent transaction, carrying their before/after reactions) and Schedule (cron/every jobs run
; at-most-once across replicas via a unique-insert claim). Server-only — it links the concrete data
; backend (for Tx + the claim collection) and Eio (for the scheduler fiber). The reactions ppx
; desugars [@before]/[@after]/[@cron]/[@every] into calls here.
